TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-1203.3404v1
AU  - MORITA∗, Takeshi
TI  - On local solutions of the Ramanujan equation and their connection formulae
DA  - D:20220606
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/1203.3404
AB  - We show connection formulae of local solutions of the Ramanujan equation between the origin and the inﬁnity. These solutions are given by the Ramanujan function, the q-Airy function and the divergent basic hypergeometric series 2ϕ0(0, 0; −; q, x). We use two diﬀerent q- Borel-Laplace transformations to obtain our connection formulae.
ER  - 
